        <item>
            <title>1.9.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:56:39 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>186</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.9.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>Install and Relaunch in the side panel works, and both buttons show &quot;Installing and relaunching…&quot; the moment you press one. If nothing happens within 30 seconds, the buttons come back.</li>
  <li>Release notes in the side panel read as formatted text: headings, lined-up bullets, bold and links.</li>
  <li>Each update&#x27;s source (&quot;Homebrew ●&quot;, &quot;App Store ●&quot;) sits in its own column before the buttons, lined up on every row.</li>
  <li>If What&#x27;s New can&#x27;t load its notes after an update, Keel tries again later instead of skipping it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
