        <item>
            <title>1.9.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:37:47 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>177</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.9.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>The progress rope keeps one length while an update runs: changing percentages and buttons no longer stretch or shrink it.</li>
  <li>Cursor updates come from Cursor&#x27;s own update service (3.29.9 while Homebrew had 3.28.7), marked &quot;From Keel&#x27;s catalog&quot;.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
